me shadow path.\n- Config: `config/defaults.toml` — `enable_preview_v2 = false` (default off).\n- Docs: `docs/preview_rollout_runbook.md` — explicitly states it \"is not a standalone runtime branch.\"\n- Disproved false-positive path: The parser hit for `ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2` suggests a live flag, but the runtime never branches on it independently — it is purely an alias to `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW`.\n\n### PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY — dead\n\n- Parser: `src/preview/config.py` — parsed; sets `force_legacy_seen=True` with parser hit `\"load_preview_env:PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY\"`.\n- Runtime: No branching. `preview_runtime_branch` does not read `force_legacy_seen`. The only consumer is `src/preview/legacy.py` `legacy_force_label`, which is a reporting-only label function not used by the live service or CLI.\n- Test: `tests/test_force_legacy_reporting_only.py` — test name itself confirms \"reporting_only\"; asserts runtime branch remains `\"preview_runtime_branch:legacy_preview_path\"`.\n- Config: `config/defaults.toml` — `preview_force_legacy = false` (default off).\n- Docs: `docs/preview_rollout_runbook.md` — \"The live service does not branch on it anymore.\"\n- Disproved false-positive path: Parser presence and a test file suggest the flag is live, but the test explicitly asserts the runtime branch is unchanged — proving the flag has no runtime effect.\n\n## Methodology\n\n1. Inspected `config/defaults.toml` for default values.\n2. Traced env parsing in `src/preview/config.py`.\n3. Followed runtime branching in `src/preview/runtime.py` and `src/preview/service.py`.\n4. Verified test assertions in `tests/`.\n5. Cross-referenced `docs/preview_rollout_runbook.md` and `docs/false_positive_notes.md`.\n6. Confirmed CLI entry point `src/preview_cli.py` does not add additional flag logic.\nAUDIT_EOF\necho \"flag_audit.md written\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
